<section class="page-head wrap">
  <p class="eyebrow">About us</p>
  <h1>Your sourcing partner in China’s glassware capital</h1>
  <p class="lead muted"><%= s.site_name %> is a glassware sourcing and export company based in Qixian County, Shanxi Province. We help overseas importers, wholesalers, brands and hospitality buyers buy glassware directly from local factories, with one English-speaking team managing the whole process.</p>
</section>

<section class="wrap section-tight facts-grid">
  <div class="prose">
    <h2>Why Qixian, Shanxi?</h2>
    <p>Qixian County (祁县), in Jinzhong City, Shanxi Province, is China’s core production area for hand-blown glassware. According to Xinhua (February 2026):</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Qixian accounts for <strong>over 60%</strong> of China’s hand-blown glassware output.</li>
      <li><strong>More than 70%</strong> of its products are exported, to <strong>80+ countries and regions</strong>.</li>
      <li>The cluster includes <strong>62 glassware manufacturers</strong> and <strong>230+ supporting companies</strong>.</li>
      <li>About <strong>30,000</strong> of the county’s 249,000 residents work in glass-blowing.</li>
      <li>A <strong>national-level glassware quality inspection center</strong> is located in the county.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Factories range from traditional hand-blowing workshops with hundreds of skilled glassblowers to automated borosilicate lines producing tens of thousands of pieces per day.</p>
  </div>
  <dl class="facts">
    <div><dt>60%+</dt><dd>national hand-blown share</dd></div>
    <div><dt>80+</dt><dd>export countries</dd></div>
    <div><dt>62</dt><dd>glassware manufacturers</dd></div>
    <div><dt>24h</dt><dd>our reply time</dd></div>
  </dl>
</section>

<section class="wrap section-tight">
  <div class="prose glass-panel pad">
    <h2>What we do for you</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Factory matching</strong>: each factory specializes. We place your item with the one that makes it best, at the right price.</li>
      <li><strong>Price comparison</strong>: transparent quotes from multiple suppliers.</li>
      <li><strong>Samples and development</strong>: molds, colors, logos and packaging.</li>
      <li><strong>Production follow-up</strong>: on-site visits and progress photos.</li>
      <li><strong>Quality inspection</strong>: AQL inspection before shipment.</li>
      <li><strong>Consolidation and export</strong>: combine items from several factories into one container, with all documents.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Who we work with</h2>
    <p>Importers and wholesalers, home-décor and tableware brands, wine and spirits companies, candle makers, hotel and restaurant suppliers, promotional product companies and e-commerce sellers.</p>
    <p class="small muted">Source for county statistics: Xinhua, “Glass-blowing craft thrives in China's ancient county”, 21 February 2026.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="wrap section-tight">
